## Swift Package Manager
.build/
.swiftpm/
# NOTE: Packages/ holds hydratype's OWN source packages (e.g. HydraCore), not
# checked-out dependencies (modern SPM uses .build/). Do NOT blanket-ignore it —
# only ignore build artifacts nested inside.
Packages/*/.build/
Packages/*/.swiftpm/
